{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10251","headline":"裴端公使院赋得隔帘见春雨 · 包何","name":"裴端公使院赋得隔帘见春雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨未成霖，垂帘但觉阴。\n唯看上砌湿，不遣入檐深。\n度隟沾霜简，因风润绮琴。\n须移户外屦，檐溜夜相侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}